-- =============================================================================
-- Shifa Herbal Remedies OMS - large TEST / DEMO seed data (V27)
--
-- ADDITIVE, self-contained test dataset layered on top of the V22 demo seed so
-- every dashboard, report, insight, pipeline and finance view has realistic
-- volume for demos, QA and screenshots. Runs in ALL Spring profiles (plain SQL,
-- no application code) and AUTO-APPLIES on server deploy (Flyway on startup).
--
-- Design notes:
--   * NON-COLLIDING explicit ids so it never clashes with V22 or runtime data:
--       users 101-123, orders 1000-1119 (codes SHR-5001..SHR-5120),
--       courier_companies 2-4, suppliers 10-14, purchase_orders 10-14.
--     Child rows (line_items, status_history, payments, courier_records,
--     receivables, stock_movements, order_returns, leads, lead_status_history,
--     admin_notifications, audit_events, expenses, purchase_order_items) use
--     AUTO_INCREMENT ids.
--   * ALL timestamps are NOW()/CURDATE()-relative (DATE_SUB(NOW(), INTERVAL n
--     MINUTE/DAY)), so the data is always "the last ~6 months" whenever applied
--     (local restart or server deploy) with no absolute dates to age out.
--   * Every login shares the password admin123 (same bcrypt hash as V22 admin).
--   * Money math mirrors V22 exactly: remaining = total - received;
--     cod_amount = collectable on delivery; customer_outstanding = 0 once
--     delivered / terminal / prepaid. status_history: first row from_status
--     NULL -> PENDING_ADMIN_APPROVAL, last to_status = the order's status,
--     timestamps strictly monotonic and within the order's lifetime.
--   * Safe on the seeded V22 dataset; never edit an applied migration. V26 is
--     the previous highest version. Conventions match V1 (InnoDB, utf8mb4).
--
-- See docs/test-data-guide.html for the full login list and a per-role tour.
-- =============================================================================

